{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events a tracker tracks, in the order tracked: what a delivery reads.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Records"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records","    .batch(strategy: .count(20))","    .deliver(to: ConsoleDestination())"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The sequence ends once the tracker’s "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/finish()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is called, or its every copy is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"released, and every record before it has been read. Records tracked while nothing is reading wait in memory, without a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bound, for the next read, so none tracked before a delivery starts, or between two, is lost."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A read whose task is cancelled returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" and takes nothing: the next read gets the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"record it was waiting for, and every one after. A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s records are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One task reads at a time, as with "},{"type":"codeVoice"